cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AnomalyClaw: Multi-Turn Refutation for Training-Free Cross-Domain Visual Anomaly Detection"
message: "If you use this software or the CrossDomainVAD-12 benchmark, please cite the paper."
type: software
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  AnomalyClaw is a training-free visual anomaly detection agent that
  judges through multi-turn refutation against normal references. It
  combines an inner refutation trajectory over a 13-tool catalog
  (visual inspection, reference understanding, frozen expert probes)
  with a parallel direct VLM judgment on the same backbone, and ships
  CrossDomainVAD-12, a 12-domain reference-based VAD benchmark.
